# local-llm-npu ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** local inference on Intel NPU through OpenVINO GenAI with NPU/GPU/CPU fallback.

**LEONES status:** P2/P3.

## Summary

The project extends local inference beyond CUDA and exposes an OpenAI-compatible API.

## ODS fit

Its main value is hardware diversity. An ODS capability registry should be able to describe NPU availability and select NPU, GPU or CPU execution according to the detected hardware.

It is a useful future branch for Intel hardware profiles, but not a priority for the current RTX 3050 target.